# Python (bridge + perception)
#
# `.pytest_cache/README.md` and the dist-info SBOMs inside a `.venv` are files
# a TOOL wrote, and they are the reason `prettier --check` could not be a gate:
# it passed on a clean checkout and failed the moment anybody ran the test
# suite, which is not a signal about the code. Both trees are gitignored, so CI
# never saw them — only the person running `bun run format` locally did.
apps/bridge/.venv
apps/bridge/uv.lock
apps/bridge/**/__pycache__
apps/perception/.venv
apps/perception/uv.lock
